cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this Lean 4 formalization, please cite the SZL Holdings research thesis (Ouroboros Thesis v9) which introduces the Lutar Invariant Λ, and reference this proof artifact."
title: "lutar-lean — Lean 4 formalization of the Lutar Invariant Λ uniqueness theorem"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 + Mathlib formalization of the four-axiom characterization of the
  Lutar Invariant Λ_k as the weighted geometric mean with Egyptian unit-fraction
  weights. Provides machine-checked statements for the uniqueness theorem
  (Theorem 1) and the min/max bound (Theorem 2), and a runtime parity check
  between the Lean Float implementation and the production TypeScript runtime.
